<title>HONG KONG: ABN launches call warrants on HK property basket.</title>
<headline>ABN launches call warrants on HK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of a basket of four blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd		    0.05  shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd	 0.05  shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd		0.075 shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd		 0.075 shares</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$15.966	 PREMIUM	 10.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3654	 GEARING	 4.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	13.JAN.98	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	 PAYDATE	 27.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$17.74	  LISTING DATE  30.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>		     ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
